  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Agric &amp; Livestock Extension Prog Phase II - Policy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">National Agric &amp; Livestock Extension Prog Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of NALEP Phase II  is the increased             contribution of agriculture and livestock to social and economic      development and poverty alleviation. NALEP II is planning to          effectively reach 560,000 farmers and assist in the formation of      6,000 CIGs and 400 focal area committees each year in all districts   of Kenya. The total Sida budget for five years is 327 MSEK</narrative>
